      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong angle. I like how you framed the \"shortsighted\" criticism—it makes our position feel more grounded in reality. \n\nOne thing though: as a professional comms expert, do you think there are any legitimate points to the opposition's argument? Or is it basically just an uninformed or selfish viewpoint that we should just dismiss entirely in the speech?",
